            "flags": [
              "aoi_defended_chart"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ask_method",
            "label": "问她会怎样开口了解",
            "next": "method_reply",
            "effects": {
              "trust": 2,
              "affection": 0,
              "respect": 2,
              "familiarity": 2
            },
            "flags": [
              "aoi_asked_patient_method"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "admit_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "她的神情缓和下来。\n「漏掉并不可怕。把患者当成一道题，才会让同样的空白反复出现。」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "admit_end",
            "label": "把那句话补进病历",
            "next": "@end",
            "effects": {
              "trust": 0,
              "affection": 0,
              "respect": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "defend_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「诊断可能不受影响，治疗却会。」\n她没有提高声音，只把病历留在本多手里。那份平静反而让反驳显得站不住脚。",
        "expression": "serious",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "defend_end",
            "label": "重新考虑她的意思",
            "next": "@end",
            "effects": {
              "trust": 0,
              "affection": 0,
              "respect": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "method_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「先别问‘还担心什么’，那很容易得到‘没什么’。」\n她示意本多回到床边。\n「问她今晚最难睡着的原因。」",
